.TH DOWNLOAD-KOTLIN-SCRIPTING-JARS 1 "September 2026" "Qore JNI"
.SH NAME
download-kotlin-scripting-jars \- download Kotlin scripting dependencies
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B download-kotlin-scripting-jars
[output-directory]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Downloads scripting dependencies for a separately managed Kotlin installation. The qore-jni-kotlin package already supplies its pinned dependencies.
.SH OPTIONS
Use a writable output directory for manual downloads. Package builds never invoke this network tool.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
